      "contextId": "p063-c1",
      "start": 237,
      "end": 291,
      "groups": [
        "p063-u0002-individual"
      ],
      "sourceText": "اللَّهُ يَشْهَدُ إِنَّ الْمُنَافِقِينَ لَكَاذِبُونَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p063-u0003",
      "text": "آنان را ببینی جسم و ظاهرشان [از آراستگی و وقار] تو را به شگفت آورد، و اگر سخن گویند [به علت",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(3) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "17b4783a2da8b91018f16ae82b9c284e36b96376cd47bacf1fef78eaf3bf52c7",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 4,
      "blockIndex": 2,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p063-c2",
      "start": 649,
      "end": 741,
      "groups": [
        "p063-textual-coordination-9e288a3d9c"
      ],
      "sourceText": "إِذَا رَأَيْتَهُمْ تُعْجِبُكَ أَجْسَامُهُمْ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p063-u0004",
      "text": "جذابیّت کلام] به سخنانشان گوش فرا می دهی [اما از پوچی باطن، سبک مغزی و",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(3) > span:nth-of-type(3)",
      "textHash": "7d884e99d599b07c6221100e1c844ebab5d81414e55b101c12b2d0a3bd442e44",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
